It seems the domain text got corrupted with many repetitions. However we can see some actions: confirm_equipment_assignment, confirm_candidate_preparedness, assign_skill_certificate, release_skill_certificate, release_compliance_certificate, reserve_equipment_resource, load_origin_payload, unload_origin_payload, load_destination_payload, unload_destination_payload, assemble_transport_leg, assemble_origin_loaded_leg, assemble_destination_loaded_leg, assemble_fully_loaded_leg, authorize_transport_leg_loading, load_container_onto_leg, stage_schedule_candidate, confirm_equipment_assignment, confirm_candidate_preparedness, attach_task_profile, etc.

But we don't see actions for linking dispatch slot, linking compliance certificate, setting candidate_finalized, setting dispatch_allocated, setting candidate_clearance_established? Actually we have establish_clearance_nominal and establish_clearance_origin_loaded actions that set candidate_clearance_established. Good.

We have action assign_skill_certificate to set candidate_skill_certificate_linked.

We have action reserve_equipment_resource to set equipment_reserved and candidate_equipment_linked.

We have action confirm_equipment_assignment to set candidate_staged_for_loading and equipment_confirmed.

We have action confirm_candidate_preparedness to set candidate_prepared.

We have action attach_task_profile to set candidate_task_profile_linked.

We have action load_origin_payload and load_destination_payload to set origin_payload_linked/destination_payload_linked and origin_node_occupied/destination_node_occupied.

We have action unload_origin_payload and unload_destination_payload to set origin_node_ready/destination_node_ready and origin_availability_confirmed/destination_availability_confirmed and cargo_available.

We have action activate_origin_node and activate_destination_node to set origin_node_ready/destination_node_ready.

We have action lock_origin_availability and lock_destination_availability to set origin_availability_locked/destination_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed/destination_availability_confirmed.

We have action mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready to set dispatch_ready.

We have action execute_origin_dispatch and execute_destination_dispatch to set dispatched, vehicle_available, dispatch_slot_available.

We have action assemble_transport_leg, assemble_origin_loaded_leg, assemble_destination_loaded_leg, assemble_fully_loaded_leg to set transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, and various leg loaded flags.

We have action authorize_transport_leg_loading to set transport_leg_loading_authorized.

We have action load_container_onto_leg to set loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked.

We have action stage_schedule_candidate to set candidate_staged_for_loading.

We have action verify_loading_profile_nominal and verify_loading_profile_destination_flag to set candidate_loading_verified.

